update gpt_apps a set starter_prompts=v.p, updated_at=now() from (values ('roleplay-companion-gpt',ARRAY['I want to roleplay a tense masquerade encounter between adult rivals, with slow-burn romance and witty dialogue.','Create an image of my mysterious masquerade character wearing a velvet cloak in a candlelit ballroom.']),('survivalist-gpt-public-open-source-for-local-deployment-by-aiwebtools',ARRAY['I need a prioritized wilderness survival plan for being stranded overnight in cold rain with minimal gear.','Create a visual checklist for my emergency backpack, organized by water, shelter, first aid, and signaling.']),('coloring-book-generator-with-compiler',ARRAY['I want a ten-page ocean animal coloring book for preschoolers, compiled into a printable PDF.','Create a black-and-white coloring page image of my friendly octopus exploring a simple coral reef.']),('game-developer-gpt',ARRAY['I want to build a browser platformer with double jumps, collectible coins, and deployable JavaScript code.','Create a pixel-art sprite sheet image for my platformer hero, including idle, running, and jumping poses.']),('hemp-gpt-cannabis-gpt-to-prepare-for-4o1',ARRAY['I want to compare hemp strain lineages and understand how genetics influence cannabinoid profiles.','Create a visual explaining how inherited traits shape my hemp cultivar''s fiber quality and cannabinoid profile.']),('talk-to-history-gpt',ARRAY['I want to interview Marie Curie about her laboratory discoveries, with answers grounded in documented history.','Create an image of my imagined meeting with Leonardo da Vinci inside his Renaissance workshop.']),('diplomatica-world-peace-nuclear-disarmament-advisor',ARRAY['I need a phased nuclear arms reduction proposal with verification measures and incentives for rival states.','Create a visual roadmap for my peace negotiation framework, linking ceasefire monitoring, confidence-building, and disarmament milestones.']),('resourcium-global-resource-manager',ARRAY['I need a freshwater scarcity assessment for my region, including demand scenarios and practical conservation priorities.','Create a visual dashboard mockup for my city''s water reserves, consumption trends, and projected shortage risks.']),('luma-dream-machine-prompt-assistant',ARRAY['I want a cinematic video prompt featuring a desert train, tracking shots, and golden-hour lighting.','Create a storyboard image for my five-second video of a glass city emerging from ocean mist.']),('true-history-truth-seeker-gpt',ARRAY['I want to investigate conflicting accounts of the Library of Alexandria''s destruction using dated primary sources.','Create a visual timeline for my investigation of disputed historical claims, distinguishing documented evidence from speculation.']),('dispensary-staff-assistant',ARRAY['I need a staff training script explaining THC, CBD, and delayed edible effects without making medical claims.','I want a dispensary opening checklist covering age verification, inventory discrepancies, and questions for our compliance officer.']),('engineering-gpt-ai-suite',ARRAY['I need to size a simply supported steel beam using my span, load, and deflection limits.','Create an annotated free-body diagram image for my cantilever bracket showing loads, reactions, and critical dimensions.']),('video-script-generator',ARRAY['I need a sixty-second product demo script with a strong hook, shot directions, and clear call-to-action.','Create a storyboard image for my cooking tutorial script, showing six key shots with caption placeholders.']),('movie-maker-studio-ai-suite',ARRAY['I want to develop a short science-fiction film with a beat sheet, screenplay, and production shot list.','Create a cinematic concept image for my film''s abandoned lunar station, emphasizing isolation and practical lighting.']),('imagination-traveler-gpt',ARRAY['I want to explore a floating city above Jupiter through an interactive journey with branching choices.','Create an image of my imaginary destination: a bioluminescent forest village built inside enormous translucent mushrooms.']),('medical-billing-coding-gpt',ARRAY['Review my deidentified encounter note and suggest ICD-10-CM codes, flagging documentation gaps before billing.','Check my outpatient claim for CPT modifier errors and explain which corrections need supporting documentation.']),('health-insurance-claims-gpt',ARRAY['Explain my insurance explanation of benefits and identify charges I should dispute with my insurer.','Draft my appeal for a denied MRI claim using the denial letter and medical necessity documentation.']),('real-estate-gpt',ARRAY['Compare my three shortlisted rental properties using cash flow, cap rate, and estimated maintenance costs.','Create an image showing my listing''s curb appeal after affordable landscaping and exterior paint improvements.']),('interior-design-gpt',ARRAY['Plan my small living room layout around a sectional, two windows, and a working fireplace.','Create an image of my bedroom redesigned with warm minimalist furniture, sage walls, and layered lighting.']),('real-estate-architect-gpt',ARRAY['Develop my duplex concept for a narrow lot, prioritizing separate entrances, daylight, and efficient circulation.','Create a conceptual floor plan image for my two-story courtyard house with three bedrooms.']),('ai-fashion-model-generator',ARRAY['Turn my streetwear collection description into detailed model casting, styling, and editorial pose prompts.','Generate an image of a fashion model wearing my oversized denim jacket in a studio campaign.']),('grant-writer-gpt-page',ARRAY['Draft my nonprofit''s grant needs statement using local food insecurity data and our program outcomes.','Build my youth literacy grant proposal around the funder''s rubric, including measurable objectives and evaluation methods.']),('gospel-of-deployment-full-book',ARRAY['Turn my selected chapter on deployable robots into an operational checklist with clearly attributed instructions.','Explain how I could apply the book''s robot deployment principles to a supervised warehouse pilot.']),('startup-validator-gpt-page',ARRAY['Stress-test my subscription meal prep startup with customer assumptions, competitor alternatives, and low-cost validation experiments.','Create a visual experiment roadmap for my startup, linking risky assumptions to measurable validation milestones.']),('materiumor-valuation-gpt',ARRAY['Estimate my item''s value from its description, condition, and comparable sales, clearly stating assumptions.','Create a visual valuation summary for my item showing comparable prices, condition adjustments, and uncertainty.']),('resume-job-finder-suite',ARRAY['Tailor my resume to this data analyst posting without inventing experience or overstating my skills.','Identify job titles matching my operations background and build targeted searches for remote midlevel roles.']),('3d-print-gpt',ARRAY['Diagnose my PLA print''s stringing and weak layer adhesion using my slicer settings and nozzle temperature.','Create an image of my printable cable organizer concept with labeled dimensions and suggested print orientation.']),('person-information-finder-gpt',ARRAY['Find my conference speaker''s public professional biography, published research, and official institutional profile, with sources.','Verify whether my prospective collaborator''s listed publications match their public university profile, flagging ambiguous name matches.']),('historical-headlines-gpt',ARRAY['Write my front-page report on the 1883 Krakatoa eruption using period language and verified historical details.','Turn my notes on the 1913 suffrage parade into a period newspaper article, distinguishing facts from reconstruction.']),('algebraic-expression-inventor-gpt',ARRAY['Invent five algebraic expressions for my class that simplify to quadratics, with worked solutions.','Create a visual showing how my expression x squared plus six x becomes a completed square.']),('alchemist-scientist-gpt',ARRAY['I want to compare historical alchemical transmutation claims with modern chemistry and nuclear physics.','I want an illustrated image of an alchemist’s laboratory, labeling apparatus with their modern scientific equivalents.']),('childrens-picture-book-maker-gpt',ARRAY['I want a twelve-page picture book about a shy dragon making friends, written for preschoolers.','I want a watercolor image for my picture book’s opening spread, showing a dragon entering kindergarten.']),('home-school-gpt',ARRAY['I live in Texas and need a homeschooling compliance checklist for my seven-year-old’s first school year.','I want a four-week homeschool fractions unit for my fourth grader, using cooking and hands-on activities.']),('pharmaceutical-assistant-gpt',ARRAY['I take levothyroxine and calcium supplements; explain timing considerations and questions I should ask my pharmacist.','I want a plain-language comparison of ibuprofen and acetaminophen, including common risks and label precautions.']),('pharma-research-pro',ARRAY['I want a cited comparison of GLP-1 receptor agonist trials, focusing on cardiovascular outcomes and study limitations.','I want a visual showing monoclonal antibody development from target discovery through clinical trials and regulatory review.']),('marriage-mender-gpt',ARRAY['I want to discuss unequal housework with my spouse without blame; draft a calm conversation opener.','I need a weekly trust-rebuilding plan after repeated broken promises, with mutual check-ins and realistic boundaries.']),('interpretis',ARRAY['I want a deconstruction of Plato’s cave in a prophetic voice, distinguishing textual evidence from symbolic interpretation.','I want to trace flood myths across cultures, separating documented connections from speculative symbolic parallels.']),('materiumor-material-valuation-gpt',ARRAY['I want to estimate scrap value for 200 kilograms of insulated copper wire, accounting for recovery yield.','I want a visual grading guide for copper scrap, highlighting contamination that affects resale value.']),('ai-tools-finder-gpt',ARRAY['I need AI transcription tools for confidential legal interviews, compared by privacy controls, accuracy, and pricing.','I want three AI video editors for captioning weekly podcasts, with export limits and subscription costs compared.']),('prompt-box',ARRAY['I want to rewrite my product-description prompt with reusable variables, brand constraints, and clear output formatting.','I want an image demonstrating how lighting and composition keywords change a product photography prompt’s results.']),('stagemaster-ai-suite-performing-arts',ARRAY['I need a six-week rehearsal schedule for a community musical, balancing choreography, vocals, and scene work.','I want a stage design image for a minimalist Macbeth production, with lighting zones and actor entrances.']),('legislation-writer-gpt',ARRAY['I want a model municipal noise ordinance with definitions, exemptions, enforcement procedures, and an appeals process.','I need my paid-leave policy converted into a state bill with numbered sections and implementation deadlines.']),('phenomenon-explorer-ai-suite',ARRAY['I want to investigate ball lightning reports, comparing proposed mechanisms, available evidence, and unresolved scientific questions.','I want an annotated image explaining how temperature inversions create superior mirages over cold ocean water.']),('drill-baby-drill-ai-suite',ARRAY['I want to compare horizontal drilling and hydraulic fracturing, including reservoir suitability, costs, and environmental risks.','I want a labeled cross-sectional image of an oil well showing casing, cement, aquifers, and reservoir rock.']),('titanic-resurrections-gpt',ARRAY['I want to reconstruct Titanic’s final hours using documented wireless messages, survivor testimony, and clearly marked uncertainties.','I want a historically grounded image reconstructing Titanic’s grand staircase before the sinking, with period-appropriate architectural details.']),('indiana-archeologist-gpt',ARRAY['I found a pottery fragment; walk me through documenting its context and identifying diagnostic features.','Create an annotated image of a Roman excavation site showing how I should interpret stratigraphic layers.']),('alan-watts-gpt-page',ARRAY['I struggle with needing control; explain how Zen views surrender without becoming passive.','I want to explore the illusion of a separate self using everyday examples and Eastern philosophy.']),('tattoo-designer-gpt',ARRAY['I want a fine-line memorial tattoo combining my grandmother''s handwriting with her favorite flower.','Create an image of my blackwork forearm tattoo featuring a raven, moon, and flowing botanical details.']),('sora-prompt-assistant',ARRAY['Turn my rainy Tokyo alley concept into a video prompt with camera movement, lighting, and timing.','Create a storyboard image for my cinematic video prompt showing a lighthouse emerging from storm clouds.'])) as v(slug,p) where a.slug=v.slug;